          },
          "description": "Join Ms. Rylee for a spooktacular time with Halloween-themed games and activities! Play “This or That,” “Would You Rather,” “Rhyme Time,” “Riddles,” and try a tongue twister. Draw a haunted house step by step, guess spooky sounds, and follow along with “Monster Says.” There’s even a “How Many Can You Name” challenge and “What’s Your Favorite” segment for extra fun. Perfect for adding a playful Halloween vibe to your day, whether at home or on the go!",
